WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.714
A ra pa belg-a ye, la a pa yeel bũmb ye.

00:00:03.794 --> 00:00:12.821
Daar a ye wĩndgẽ, a zẽka a koɛɛg n yeele: "Sẽnkembeoogo, tõnd na n dɩka bũmb nins fãa sẽn ketã".

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:16.615
B ra segd n dɩta bũmb fãa n yaool n pʋɩ.

00:00:16.695 --> 00:00:22.307
A Rahaab kẽe roogẽ wã yʋng kãng bala, n dɩ, n yaool n le dɩ.

00:00:22.387 --> 00:00:28.568
A sẽn wa n dat n yiẽ wã, a pʋgã ra yaa gãnd tɩ b ra tõe n kẽ-a ye.
